Z||000004||MrPBody||02-12-2001||07:59 PM||||So, what does your uncle like to work on?<P>I ain't sayin' that the 2.5 is GM's best engine.  Fiero, on the other hand, is a hell of a car!  It deserves -- and often gets -- a better engine.<P>This may sound like plain prejudice, but I base my opinion on many years of owning and working on weird cars.||||reg||1
