Z||000006||gabriel||02-12-2001||10:39 PM||||&gt;Um, should I be worried? <P>  I'd be worried that my uncle was an idiot.<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">   (just kidding)<P> Seriously, I just got back from a body shop - I was getting estimates for a paint job. (just for reference - I'm shooting it myself) and the body mechanics all said that they felt that the Fiero was really one of the best designed cars that they had ever worked on.   Of course they quoted $1800 dollars for the job, and I'd already done all the prep, primer & block work, so go figure.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  I think that I'd spend the $1800 on another Fiero or two!<BR>  ||||reg||1
